! Projection Loom — Operator/Lares handoff XII

''Scope.'' PR #84; working branch feature/green-jello-dinosaur-5--projection-loom;
inspected prior handoff head 8fdc71d on 2026-10-23 (America/Los_Angeles).
Fetch the live branch head on every re-entry. This meme carries a //volatile
handoff//, not enduring architectural canon or a second noosphere boot.

''Authoritative human runbook.'' tools/projection-loom/docs/HANDOFF.md.
''Stable method.'' lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/projection-loom-capability-composition.
''Boot.'' Read the live noosphere-boot.mem on its default branch before action.

<<~/ahu>>

