<<~ ahu #/backlog>>
!! Ordered backlog / re-entry keys

P0: Keep PR Loom CI green; investigate general CI red; approve CC0 lock;
    verify immutable recipe/implementation/source checkpoint identity.
P1: Test multi-resolution crystal sculpting, joining forms, and alternative
    quality-diversity generations against CAD-only and held-out witnesses;
